{"id":"civil","lemma":"civil","pos":"adj","rank":1840,"glosses":["civil (all senses)"],"ipa":"/θiˈbil/","forms":{"femininePlural":"civiles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-civil.wav","examples":[{"text":"Murieron algunos civiles.","en":"Some civilians were killed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/509987","words":[{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},null]},{"text":"Murieron cuatro soldados y doce civiles.","en":"Four soldiers and twelve civilians were killed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692423","words":[{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"a four-stringed guitar…"},{"g":"soldier","l":"soldado"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"twelve"},null]},{"text":"Tom es civil.","en":"Tom is a civilian.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800098","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Estas personas dijeron que la guerra era una guerra civil.","en":"These people said the war was a civil war.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692815","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"person (an individual","l":"persona"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"war, warfare"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"war, warfare"},null]},{"text":"Él fue despojado de sus derechos civiles.","en":"He was deprived of his civil rights.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514858","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"bare"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},{"g":"right","l":"derecho"},null]}]}